Generate Linty elaboration scripts for the open Vivado project.

The command takes no arguments. A project must already be open, and the source fileset must have a top module. It writes two files under .linty/yosys in the parent of the Vivado project directory:

  read.ys        Yosys script that reads the synthesis sources
  hierarchy.ys   Yosys script that elaborates the top module

Files that are not emitted as HDL reads, such as EDIF, are printed to the console.
